## Responsible AI and Privacy Considerations

Because the system uses facial recognition and processes personal information, responsible AI practices are an essential part of its development.

The project will emphasize:

- Obtaining appropriate user consent before facial enrollment.
- Protecting personally identifiable and biometric information.
- Implementing secure data storage and access controls.
- Limiting the collection and retention of personal data.
- Maintaining transparency regarding facial recognition usage.
- Considering recognition accuracy, potential bias, and system limitations.

